WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:13.208
What is going on?

00:00:13.208 --> 00:00:15.000
Shhh....it’s the trade deadline

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:17.041
This could be our ticket out of here

00:00:17.541 --> 00:00:18.916
Why would you want to leave?

00:00:19.125 --> 00:00:20.833
Aren’t we in line for the first pick?

00:00:20.833 --> 00:00:21.875
No, we’re not!

00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:24.208
Because that fool Billy King traded it to

00:00:24.208 --> 00:00:25.583
Boston a few years ago!

00:00:25.666 --> 00:00:26.041
What!?

00:00:26.041 --> 00:00:27.625
I know! They’re idiots--

00:00:27.625 --> 00:00:28.625
Der coming! Der coming!

00:00:28.708 --> 00:00:29.458
Back up, back up!

00:00:29.458 --> 00:00:30.375
Everybody back up!

00:00:32.041 --> 00:00:33.416
I’m sorry to announce...

00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:35.000
we have made a trade

00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:36.833
Oh yes oh yes

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.625
Please please please

00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:41.250
Bojan

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:41.958
Yeah

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:42.958
You’re going to Washingfell

00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:44.166
Sorry

00:00:44.166 --> 00:00:44.875
Oh my god!

00:00:44.875 --> 00:00:45.708
They are like, uh...

00:00:45.708 --> 00:00:46.833
They have like...wins

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:47.291
Yes

00:00:47.291 --> 00:00:48.291
Thirty-four wins, they have

00:00:48.291 --> 00:00:49.291
THIRTY-FOUR?!

00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:51.500
Oh man, that’s like so many wins!

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.041
I know you’re disappointed, but...

00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:54.083
pack your bags

00:00:54.625 --> 00:00:55.958
They expect you there on the morrow

00:00:55.958 --> 00:00:57.666
Right. Right. Oh yeah I’m very sad

00:00:57.666 --> 00:01:00.333
This is so--I’m very sad but I’ll go pack now

00:01:00.625 --> 00:01:01.750
and fight all the tears

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.833
Um...love all you guys!

00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:06.958
Thanks, uh, Lord Commander--ex-Lord Commander!

00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:08.208
Oh this is so sad!

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.041
This is SO GOOD! OH I’M FREE! 

00:01:11.208 --> 00:01:13.583
I’M FREE FROM THIS PIECE OF SHIT TEAM!

00:01:13.666 --> 00:01:15.791
THIS IS THE HAPPIEST DAY OF MY LIFE!

00:01:16.083 --> 00:01:18.250
I DON’T HAVE TO BE IN STUPID BROOKLYN

00:01:18.416 --> 00:01:20.083
THIS IS THE DUMBEST PLACE

00:01:20.208 --> 00:01:21.958
WORST FRANCHISE  EVER!

00:01:22.125 --> 00:01:23.125
MAN THESE GUYS ARE F--

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:26.041
Any..uh...other trades to report? Or...

00:01:26.166 --> 00:01:27.166
No

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:28.500
Dammit!

00:01:28.541 --> 00:01:30.250
Now, come on, it's time to practice

00:01:30.458 --> 00:01:32.541
Tomorrow we lose to the Nuggets!

00:01:44.166 --> 00:01:45.458
Who goes there?

00:01:45.791 --> 00:01:47.291
House Magic!

00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:48.750
What are they doing here?

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.375
We don’t play ‘em for a fortnight

00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:51.666
What do you want?

00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:54.958
We want to propose a trade!

00:01:55.166 --> 00:01:57.416
Well we don’t need a trade.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:59.000
We’re contenders!

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:01.875
Oh come on now, you’re fifth in the East!

00:02:02.041 --> 00:02:04.997
You’re worse than the...Hawks right now!

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.241
Don’t you want to compete with the Cavs?

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:07.908
I mean, It’s true

00:02:07.916 --> 00:02:09.083
We could use, like, a power forward

00:02:09.075 --> 00:02:10.575
Well then do it! Do it! Do it!

00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:12.750
Well alright, whaddya got?

00:02:13.083 --> 00:02:14.708
Serge Ibaka!

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:19.500
He shoots, dunks, and he’s an elite rim protector.

00:02:19.833 --> 00:02:21.416
He’s everything you need

00:02:21.416 --> 00:02:22.791
Isn’t that right Serge?

00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:24.500
I defend anyone

00:02:25.202 --> 00:02:26.447
Except LeBron

00:02:26.841 --> 00:02:28.091
Alright. Okay

00:02:28.466 --> 00:02:29.883
Well what do you want for him?

00:02:30.819 --> 00:02:33.194
DeMar DeRozan!

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:35.527
No! He’s my friend!

00:02:35.527 --> 00:02:36.736
Argh. Very well

00:02:36.927 --> 00:02:38.136
Worth a shot

00:02:38.722 --> 00:02:40.013
Then give us...

00:02:40.783 --> 00:02:42.283
Norman Powell!

00:02:42.636 --> 00:02:43.427
No!

00:02:43.922 --> 00:02:45.797
He's...too young!

00:02:46.388 --> 00:02:47.661
But I’m also your friend, right?

00:02:47.661 --> 00:02:48.661
Shush Norman!

00:02:48.661 --> 00:02:49.925
I'm trying to make a trade here!

00:02:50.161 --> 00:02:51.536
I am also his friend!

00:02:51.541 --> 00:02:52.125
Norman!

00:02:52.211 --> 00:02:55.377
Alright. Well then what else do you have to offer?

00:02:55.430 --> 00:02:56.763
We’ll give you...

00:02:57.147 --> 00:02:58.397
Can we trade Drake?

00:02:58.541 --> 00:02:59.916
I don’t think so. No

00:02:59.905 --> 00:03:01.005
What about Terrence?

00:03:01.083 --> 00:03:02.250
What about Terr--

00:03:02.333 --> 00:03:03.833
You can have Terrence Ross

00:03:04.108 --> 00:03:05.441
Well what does he do?

00:03:05.958 --> 00:03:06.833
He’s like...

00:03:07.655 --> 00:03:08.988
an older Norman

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:09.763
No I’m not

00:03:09.763 --> 00:03:11.969
Terrence! You’ll like it in Orlando. It’s warm

00:03:11.969 --> 00:03:13.302
Let the man speak! 

00:03:13.577 --> 00:03:16.286
Terrence, what do you do?

00:03:16.438 --> 00:03:19.972
Well, I’m a pretty good 3 and D player...

00:03:19.972 --> 00:03:20.586
Um...

00:03:20.586 --> 00:03:23.377
though some people might call me inconsistent...

00:03:23.655 --> 00:03:25.508
So maybe I’m not a good 3 and D player--

00:03:25.508 --> 00:03:26.830
No no no, you are!

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:29.538
I AM a good 3 and D player

00:03:29.705 --> 00:03:31.738
OH! And a decorated dunker!

00:03:31.944 --> 00:03:33.661
Well he’s certainly inconsistent

00:03:33.666 --> 00:03:35.883
Throw in a draft pick and it’s a deal!

00:03:35.883 --> 00:03:36.591
A draft pi--

00:03:36.755 --> 00:03:39.380
Fine, but then you gotta give us somethin’ else too!

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:41.075
Something else? Ugh

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:43.605
Alright we’ll give you a choice

00:03:44.077 --> 00:03:47.854
You can either have...Mario Hezonja...

00:03:48.213 --> 00:03:50.932
Or...this horse

00:03:51.947 --> 00:03:54.091
Well what does Mario do?

00:03:54.091 --> 00:03:56.341
He scores three points a game

00:03:56.441 --> 00:03:58.358
And what does the horse do?

00:03:58.369 --> 00:04:00.411
It’s a f-- it’s a horse!

00:04:01.094 --> 00:04:04.455
It walks around with people on it

00:04:04.455 --> 00:04:07.141
I don’t know...does horse things!

00:04:07.141 --> 00:04:09.725
That kid was the fifth pick in the draft.  He's probably got potential.

00:04:09.725 --> 00:04:11.850
Yeah but it's a horse! It does horse things!

00:04:12.683 --> 00:04:14.058
We’ll take the horse!

